5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"hJTwBhYBTkiHaDMml_v_sw","review_id":"8B9U73AZzkJCUZsbGewlgw","date":"2018-01-10T06:36:48","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9284729957580566,"text_excerpt":"My daughter and I were on our way home from a long day of volunteering and decided to stop here. This was my first time at Panera. I ordered the creamy tomato soup in a sourdough bread bowl. It was just what I wanted on a cold day. My daughter ordered a half sandwich with chips. You order at the counter, get your own drink and seat yourself. They give you a pager that alerts you when your order is ready. Someone also called my name out as the pager began to go off. The food was good, restaurant was clean, plenty of seating and prices were ok. Parking is free and easy in their lot. I could see myself eating there again."},{"business_id":"hJTwBhYBTkiHaDMml_v_sw","review_id":"PbZraUpASS6RRflXC5BT6g","date":"2017-12-11T18:21:58","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9205287098884583,"text_excerpt":"Panera gets 5 stars simply because everyone I movie order to the wrong store they still prepare my food. Ha! So thank you to whomever owns this local store. I forgot his name but I've seen him in store a few times. The employees here are always nice too. I know it's all technically reheated soups BUT I like to think it's all made specifically for me when I arrive. How else is my soup so hot and bread warm perfectly? Right. If only I could get that squash soup year round. It's ok because the Mediterranean sandwich is always there. Also, sign up for the rewards program if you haven't already. Everyone loves free stuff."},{"business_id":"hJTwBhYBTkiHaDMml_v_sw","review_id":"vbTz_5CEMmpPszUz1ICjHA","date":"2014-09-11T03:04:08","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9202166795730591,"text_excerpt":"Soup in a bread bowl. I could eat it every day for the rest of my life (and very well may). Great place to a get a healthy(ish) lunch. The employees are friendly and during the lunch hour they're moving at lightning speed. Just be prepared to answer a lot of questions when you make your order (here? to go? name? 99 cent pastry? panera card?)."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"hJTwBhYBTkiHaDMml_v_sw","photo_id":"5rDd68u2nDfI9bNSiMGhMQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/5rDd68u2nDfI9bNSiMGhMQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9070926904678345},{"business_id":"hJTwBhYBTkiHaDMml_v_sw","photo_id":"U4_f83fg5I84JGdzpx1aKg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/U4_f83fg5I84JGdzpx1aKg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9070926308631897}]},"notebook_case":null}
